1. She previously worked in an office job in IT. (Verbatim: "I used to always, always, always complain about Tuesdays when I worked in the, like, office thingy as IT.")

2. She used to babysit children as a past job or activity. (Verbatim: "I remember when I used to babysit, so I used to be a babysitter, and I remember the kids that I would babysit would be like, Oh my god, Elliot, I want to be just like you when I grow up.")

3. She struggled with self-care while studying, prioritizing academic performance over personal well-being due to parental pressure. (Verbatim: "one thing I never did enough of was look after myself when I studied... my parents made me think it was like the most important thing ever.")

4. She used watching anime as a reward system during study sessions, which sometimes led to binge-watching. (Verbatim: "the anime was a reward for passing certain amounts of study... if the episode ends on a cliffhanger, I'll watch two episodes, and then if that next episode ends on a cliffhanger, I'll watch a third...")

5. She is not an auditory learner and found university lectures ineffective for her learning style. (Verbatim: "I am not a listen learner... lectures at university just went through one ear, out the other... I heard what you said, my dude, but I also didn't hear what you said, my dude.")

6. She developed a personalized study method involving transcribing recorded lectures and reformatting them for better retention. (Verbatim: "I would transcribe it all, and then following the transcription of it all, I would then put it into a format that I could remember a bit more.")

7. She believes teaching others (or imagining teaching) is the best way to learn and retain knowledge. (Verbatim: "the best way to learn and retain knowledge is to imagine yourself as a teacher that has to teach someone else.")

8. She currently uses a temporary VTuber model because the full version is not ready and VTubing is expensive. (Verbatim: "this is just a temporary model... vtubing is expensive and takes a while... my form isn't ready.")

9. She has been to Japan, where she uploaded many of her videos from her phone. (Verbatim: "most of them were uploaded while i was in japan um where i i just i just did it on my phone.")

10. She drinks passion fruit squash, which she notes is called cordial by some viewers. (Verbatim: "it is passion fruit... squash is what I call it here but I believe y'all call it cordial.") [end of text]



