3. She has a strong dislike for moths, especially when many are flying around at once. (Verbatim: "no moths are not cute when there's like 50 of them flying around like um yeah yeah it was like it got pretty bad")

4. She is disturbed by large, thick-legged spiders the size of a hand, though she generally doesn’t mind spiders. (Verbatim: "i do mind the thick-legged boy the thick-legged spiders um worry me you know like big thick spiders like the ones that are like i don't know the size of your hand")

5. She once forgot a bag of potatoes in a cupboard during university, leading to a scary root system growing inside. (Verbatim: "i bought a bag of potatoes and i put it in the cupboard once um and then i forgot about it this was at uni... a whole root system had grown so scary it was so scary")

6. She lived in multiple places in England that had severe bug infestations, including moths and spiders, except her current residence. (Verbatim: "the places i've lived in have had bugs except for the place i'm in now")

7. She once accidentally disturbed a ball of baby spiders, which left a lasting impression and warns others to avoid doing the same. (Verbatim: "don't ever make sure make sure you check what a ball of baby spiders looks like so you never have to accidentally touch it or poke it with a stick")

8. She grew up mostly in a place with many moths and spiders, indicating a long-standing exposure to bug-infested environments. (Verbatim: "mostly grew up in mostly have moths and i can't remember i remember oh no a lot of spiders")

9. She fondly remembers Christmas as a child and still loves it, associating it with excitement and anticipation. (Verbatim: "as a kid i was i was super hyped for christmas it was like the bestest time... i can love christmas well i still love christmas")

10. She previously lived on a very tight budget, surviving on 30p garlic bread and instant noodles, which she acknowledges negatively impacted her health. (Verbatim: "a few years ago i was living on like 30p garlic bread like just 30p garlic bread and instant noodles... my health was quite in the bin back then because of my lack of vitamins") [end of text]



