9. Elia lives in a small flat and would like a larger home primarily to give her dog more space, possibly with a garden. (Verbatim: "The only reason I'd want to have like a house or something is just so I could have more space for my dog. I feel like she deserves a proper garden.")

10. She owns a dog and may consider getting a cat in the future if space allows. (Verbatim: "I feel like she deserves a proper garden. Um, mm, mm, mm. And then, and then I can maybe get a cat or something.") [end of text]



